eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256987246/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1701902947","hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/994140/637615/5dfd7b10fdbd9164d6c7a5c1fd91ea322947b3ec/1751173633/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1701902947","mp4":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/256987246/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Achievements","Steam Cloud","Steam Trading Cards","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"controller":null,"dev":["Tunnel Vision Games"],"pub":["Aspyr"],"released":"Jan 15, 2020","meta":73,"langs":["English","Danish","French","Italian","German","Spanish - Spain","Japanese","Russian","Simplified Chinese","Portuguese - Brazil"],"min":[["OS","Windows 10"],["Processor","Intel Core i3 4170 / AMD A8-7600"],["Memory","8 GB RAM"],["Graphics","NVIDIA GTX 660 / AMD R9 270"],["Storage","6 GB available space"]],"rec":[],"deck":2,"blurb":"Shadows are lethal in this first-person puzzle game. You work through its environments using lamps, beams and platforms to carve safe routes through the dark, since stepping into shadow means death. Lateral thinking is required, whether that means carrying a light source with you or repositioning one to light a gap you need to cross.\n\nThe setting is Lightmatter Technologies, led by its CEO Virgil, voiced by David Bateson, whose optimistic talk of a bright energy future runs through the game. The developers describe it as a love letter to first-person puzzlers. It is single-player and suits fans of that style who like light-based puzzles with a dark sense of humor."}}